@WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5175

### GET all persons
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Accept: application/json
###

### CREATE PERSON
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Karol",
  "lastName": "Kopacz",
  "email": "karol@wsei.edu.pl",
  "phone": "48 123 456 789",
  "gender": 0
}

###

### GET PERSON BY ID
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/fd70525e-e2ab-4c63-b236-07391b21640c
Accept: application/json


###

### UPDATE PERSON
PUT {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/fd70525e-e2ab-4c63-b236-07391b21640c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "fd70525e-e2ab-4c63-b236-07391b21640c",
  "firstName": "AdamTest",
  "lastName": "NowakTest",
  "email": "adam.updated@email.com",
  "phone": "999999999",
  "gender": 0
}
###

### Create Note
POST http://localhost:5175/api/contacts/fd70525e-e2ab-4c63-b236-07391b21640c/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Pierwsza notatka"
}
###

###Delete
DELETE http://localhost:5175/api/contacts/fd70525e-e2ab-4c63-b236-07391b21640c/notes/48e48e59-0b92-4c14-897d-815e94f6e23b

###
GET http://localhost:5175/api/contacts
Accept: application/json


### Login
POST http://localhost:5175/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jan.kowalski@crm.pl",
  "password": "Manager@123!"
}

### Get contacts without token
GET http://localhost:5175/api/contacts
Accept: application/json

### Get contacts with token
GET http://localhost:5175/api/contacts
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..WBbtRBBtBaGm3Hd-vXq9WO9rTTAS2l-xTZJt1ZFArGs

