### Import JSON Poprawne Rekordy
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contact-import
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..uWZRkDI1695tzOHqkA1VkhRWQBv0QtTWvfaIq3q4lkE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contacts-import.json"
Content-Type: application/json

< ./JsonImport.json
--boundary--


### Import JSON Niepoprawne Rekordy
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contact-import
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..uWZRkDI1695tzOHqkA1VkhRWQBv0QtTWvfaIq3q4lkE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contacts-import.json"
Content-Type: application/json

< ./JsonImportErrorTest.json
--boundary--


### Import CSV Poprawne Rekordy
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contact-import
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..uWZRkDI1695tzOHqkA1VkhRWQBv0QtTWvfaIq3q4lkE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contacts-import.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./CsvImport.csv
--boundary--

### Import CSV Niepoprawne Rekordy
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contact-import
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..xgB8jxWiSFSn_XJ4K8wkaeDSlqv-9FUNts4hcwO-9lE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contacts-import.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./CsvImportErrorTest.csv
--boundary--

